02:10:23.842 --> 02:10:26.842
Out of respect for the other people who are still being blessed.

1207
02:10:26.842 --> 02:10:27.842
So do not leave.

1208
02:10:27.842 --> 02:10:29.842
I do not like that kind of religion.

1209
02:10:29.842 --> 02:10:34.842
Do not go pick up your anointing and then quickly run away.

1210
02:10:34.842 --> 02:10:36.842
Because it is not a factory.

1211
02:10:36.842 --> 02:10:38.842
We are together a spiritual house.

1212
02:10:38.842 --> 02:10:39.842
Amen.

1213
02:10:39.842 --> 02:10:41.842
So you can come forward.

1214
02:10:41.842 --> 02:10:43.842
Leaders are coming to stand here at this moment.

1215
02:10:43.842 --> 02:10:45.842
Leaders, you can take your positions already.

1216
02:10:45.842 --> 02:10:48.842
And you can gather as a family.

1217
02:10:48.842 --> 02:10:50.842
And you can come forward.

1218
02:10:50.842 --> 02:10:52.842
And then we will pray for everyone.

1219
02:10:52.842 --> 02:10:54.842
If you are alone, come alone.

1220
02:10:54.842 --> 02:10:55.842
If you are a couple, come together.

1221
02:10:55.842 --> 02:10:57.842
If you are in a family, you come together.

1222
02:10:57.842 --> 02:11:00.842
And we are going to bless everyone in the name of Jesus.

1223
02:11:00.842 --> 02:11:01.842
Hallelujah.

1224
02:11:08.842 --> 02:11:09.842
Amen.
